  "title": "です & ます",
  "subtitle": "Polite from the start",
  "intro": "Japanese has politeness levels built right in — and the good news is that the basic level isn't hard at all. With です and ます you're well equipped for the vast majority of situations. Whether in a shop, at the train station, at the doctor's or with new acquaintances: so-called \"teineigo\" (丁寧語, polite language) is the standard every learner of Japanese should master first. Everything else builds on it.",
